[nvq@l.cc.purdue.edu (Michael J. Scholl) writes:]
[]Can you eat the following creatures, and if so, are there any
[]side-effects, beneficial or otherwise??
[]Vampire
[]Xan
[]Wumpus
[]Black Naga

you can eat anything (within reason) once you have poison resistance.
in that sense, you could eat the above monsters. i could be wrong but
i think that all of the above can be poisonous except the wumpus. it
is sometimes possible to eat a poisonous monster and not be poisoned.
the poisonous monsters can potentially give you poison resistance but
you could lose stength a/o HP's in the process. vampires could give
you sleep resistance. i'm not sure about other intrinsics.

you should eating plenty of cave spiders or brown molds before trying
to eat poisonous monsters if you're not intrinsically poison resistant.

the eating activity, itself, has different effects (i.e. you could
go blind).

